      "title": "RTP Player: Fix: Only silence played on Windows with Qt 6.x",
      "message": "RTP Player: Fix: Only silence played on Windows with Qt 6.x\n\nQt 6.x has different timing of events during audio play than Qt 5.x on Win32\nor Qt6.x on Linux/Mac. It caused race condition which removed stream from\nplayback queue sooner it was really played. It was random (some audio streams\ntriggered it, some didn't).\n\nCloses #18413\n",
